{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">印度近年來除了自2022 年 9 月正式啟動「獵豹復育計劃」，從納米比亞和南非跨國引進非洲獵豹，亦積極推動大型貓科動物的保育與重引入計劃，據印度環境、森林與氣候變化部國務部長Kirti Vardhan Singh在社交媒體發文表示，雌虎T138已踏進野外新家園。這標誌着印度老虎保育工作邁出新一步。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"20261006 TIGER\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026efAiHBwfXn1791254463.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"20261006 TIGER\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>從比哈爾邦轉移至西孟加拉邦</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">T138從比哈爾邦的瓦爾米基老虎保護區轉移，標誌着西孟加拉邦巴克薩老虎保護區的老虎重引入計劃正式展開。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"20261006 TIGER\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026GaMJB9tDRH1791254476.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"20261006 TIGER\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T03:20:06.053104+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}